{"title":"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be the number of ordered triples <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71bc7a66472f14d58d96e940db6ebc9f101b08e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A,B,C)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> of integers satisfying the conditions:\n</p><p>(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/b/4cbb6f2de81e30f65f23380d80bd5899d0356743.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le A&lt;B&lt;C\\le99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"166\" height=\"15\" />, \n</p><p>(b) there exist integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and prime <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb3ecfda5ac385cabd4442fbc9de1a4eb94a3d78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le b&lt;a&lt;c&lt;p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" />, \n</p><p>(c) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/9/6093f5a693002de90d41cd5f33ec5d7ed02bf745.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A-a$\" width=\"45\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4057e591f8ab22b023330aad59c4c81d7328bf46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B-b$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/b/73b4c6b69a4cede53ce8bb05b17064587c9cd6cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C-c$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, and \n</p><p>(d) each ordered triple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71bc7a66472f14d58d96e940db6ebc9f101b08e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A,B,C)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> and each ordered triple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add70ebd796f986af030cff63c8de5b1901f0787.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b,a,c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> form arithmetic sequences. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From condition (d), we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/5/7159ae819a8ded85367d24cfdb78f0fcb09faf12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A,B,C)=(B-D,B,B+D)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"245\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/c/23cba8ebb9bb15639628a9cb9ddac3dff9e9263a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b,a,c)=(a-d,a,a+d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"201\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nNow, we substitute these values in. Condition <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/5/145ce875a7e1d7b082254b40e2e4956f791773b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(c)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" /> states that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/5/c550af384f7da65c71ac46021e918b27eb8de792.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\mid B-D-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/c/8ccced07d3b638db855f02e1efb5bc49b5db0133.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p | B-a+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/4/03443a954c916a3e1172e2a836dd2832f4f56171.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\mid B+D-a-d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"141\" height=\"18\" />. We subtract the first two to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/d/d5de8855c55bda49c3031c9e05fedc76e12a24f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\mid-d-D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />, and we do the same for the last two to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/8/078c9a5916aa9fd279bfd215c63365eb0bfa3f4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\mid 2d-D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" />. We subtract these two to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/5/585ca19cd9cfea6eaa91bc7a11c4bf5530c29d94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\mid 3d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"18\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/0/dd06286167cd0256f8ad4b571c228528a7aa6250.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\mid 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/2/c32f453cf958202ff8239ce2c2146470fe9da9fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\mid d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" />. The second case is clearly impossible, because that would make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/d/f4d5e38ffd118d773080e80481b7184d20b35051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=a+d&gt;p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />, violating condition <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/0/bd0e921c3b119d78e00ce6937a67bf5388578515.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(b)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" />. So we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/0/dd06286167cd0256f8ad4b571c228528a7aa6250.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\mid 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54cfc82a82f113a7432ca68f71338c383bbcb44b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />. Condition <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/0/bd0e921c3b119d78e00ce6937a67bf5388578515.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(b)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/5/0553b856bb0eedd59df6b1cc4f5f767b3a9cb24e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b,a,c)=(0,1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"139\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/e/69efe3ebbee4d25f375d3f4795aedb77719db378.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)\\in (1,0,2)\\rightarrow (-2,0,2)\\text{ }(D\\equiv 2\\text{ mod 3})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"357\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p><br />\nNow we return to condition <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/5/145ce875a7e1d7b082254b40e2e4956f791773b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(c)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" />, which now implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/0/2a04efe7eb0b39ce826ed0187f3fc03275dc48fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A,B,C)\\equiv(-2,0,2)\\pmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"239\" height=\"18\" />. Now, we set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba563c667f17195cf0c330571b02fd9ff6e0f15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=3k$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> for increasing positive integer values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/33535d13e10f27c6657f5795ecb46f5c415ad539.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=0$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> yields no solutions. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67c2c9486777b4b59b7f5cf1af4476b219edeff4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=3$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bd296c8795d649b7323cd33785f2305a63e3012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A,B,C)=(1,3,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"153\" height=\"18\" />, giving us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solution. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/8/0d8bf07ee84f662b92a5e79d6104b18e541841a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=6$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/0/e001d930389ba474378761b063d9d1f32368ad29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4,6,8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a25ba618b4d92561f9be7f1d63c08323e623882.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,6,11)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />. Proceeding in the manner, we see that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/4/2644c635fa4ec5d4ebb607ccc73e6ae4f8eef93b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=48$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" />, we get 16 solutions. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/0/b7059b656c47b53443e0ce1655a9b7aeb120d8a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=51$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> still gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> solutions because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62fcf5b79663dea10521fda0dcd26ec22665061b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_\\text{max}=2B-1=101&gt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"220\" height=\"15\" />. Likewise, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/2/9c2d15cfcf82d8ddae1ed6f011109c5b97078b09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=54$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> solutions. This continues until <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/4/004d34d9e3ae23d583c40491e7892bd56ebec3bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=96$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> gives one solution. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/7/6078d7d7b32a2167314f15893bffa3f383da1ae3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=99$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> gives no solution. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/d/dcd485dd3a372dd0c64f36ab09cb13bff9ff9147.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=1+2+\\cdots+16+16+15+\\cdots+1=2\\cdot\\frac{16(17)}{2}=16\\cdot 17=\\boxed{272}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"558\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/3/6a3f5970e36255af9a497c173c5de5497b9ee1fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A, B, C) = (B-x, B, B+x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"239\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/8/0a8c59dc2c516f9036a022840e602a5560ec903e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b, a, c) = (a-y, a, a+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\" />. Now the 3 differences would be \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/e/fde207e212e6c6251b50a1b7351f2cfd2aaefe54.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align} \\label{1} &amp;A-a = B-x-a \\\\ \\label{2} &amp;B - b = B-a+y \\\\ \\label{3} &amp;C - c = B+x-a-y  \\end{align}\" width=\"358\" height=\"67\" />\n</p><p>Adding equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88ea3916e8089c7edbccc3ff91e58e01a6e2682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> would give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/6/646b4879d4c9acfbd9f664bf6cff4a4fdd397896.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2B - 2a - y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" />. Then doubling equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> would give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/6/7f61b7168062ad21e1089feabe9f7bacc2b21f36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2B - 2a + 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />. The difference between them would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/3/89385605cebfe24cd5d7a9402a2908b64a012fa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/8/1088e2271fd9488422971dfb5792c60fe37bf85c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p|\\{(1), (2), (3)\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/1/8e1024ed8b89c6002ba4db785bb5ff918fac9931.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p|3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"35\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is prime, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/9/719c97ce5057cb770dc17db3ea953ebf939a1c5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p|3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/1/861b11c2ec0a6ffd972dc73fd4209235357064b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p|y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" />. However, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/d/72d2dd8a8bd52c31d6df3f8a86654667ac17f1b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p &gt; y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/9/719c97ce5057cb770dc17db3ea953ebf939a1c5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p|3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"18\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54cfc82a82f113a7432ca68f71338c383bbcb44b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54cfc82a82f113a7432ca68f71338c383bbcb44b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />, the only possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/c/60c1ffa3e7ce1082893a5d87acd198d754f31fe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b, a, c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/041f295f2e5decbadf0f3aa2c7118a0e15771261.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, 1, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />. Plugging this into our differences, we get \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/c/d4c71f35e46660b0a11ed530d3bfeef54b185a6c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}  &amp;A-a = B-x-1 \\hspace{4cm}(4)\\\\  &amp;B - b = B \\hspace{5.35cm}(5)\\\\  &amp;C - c = B+x-2 \\hspace{4cm}(6) \\end{align*}\" width=\"358\" height=\"68\" />\nThe difference between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/104992efa4deaa9a2dfeeec9b331ad0bf628f80a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/7/737a366a904e00f936f8728869ad8f2587dab46f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccb103143393c0119f5ab61d6d53a852ce70fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, which should be divisible by 3. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/4/2447c90a6534a02740e3eac7e1a712899fefd850.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\equiv 2 \\mod 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" />. Also note that since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/a/6da06ef9cf82473528525fee56d85d39b1e6a5a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3|(5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/2/5729eb09aeece7c07ee5b743e5eeb62d17fedd6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3|B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"20\" />. Now we can try different values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/5/a757666c684908743490208c8f7807d266630ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=3, 6, ..., 96 \\Rightarrow 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" /> triples.\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/c/51c80ea5862b45877f08d698a0c893bd2806a2fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/a/bea60c09ba9cda3febf09ce8de99a4789e7c558f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=6, 9, ..., 93\\Rightarrow 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" /> triples..\n</p><p>... and so on until\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/e/21ee31ab138c8cbc449c7b02e8da43e73c3e07e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/7/4970dec8004721290f424ce8616bde65bc3cbf6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=48, 51\\Rightarrow 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" /> triple. \n</p><p>So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96bba5f1850ae1a306947e0e11054b829538c7cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32 + 30 + \\cdots + 2 = \\boxed{272}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"198\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~SoilMilk\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/f/4cf1e50420b93b2bbee4d16d4fc82048c1a5e9dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=B-A=C-B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"162\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/2/6729474d355bec656bc3aaaf03ecb3e64df86186.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e=a-b=c-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" /> be the common difference of the two sequences. We have \n\\begin{align*}\nA=a+pi\\\\\nB=b+pj\\\\\nC=c+pk\n\\end{align*}\nFor some integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/d/a2d90b0ab7269c8f0c7109f1c7a3bdfa3a5fa49c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i,j,k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"18\" />. Computing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/b/f1b733a187ce539dcda5cdc3d49df586c7373f22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B-A$\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4abac2545d5e96c63cb6f2212f9984b1a8572e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C-B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" />, we have\n\\begin{align*}\nB-A=d=(b-a)+p(j-i)\\\\\nC-B=d=(c-b)+p(k-j)\n\\end{align*}\nSubtracting the two equations again, we find\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/a/dda17e2382571ba8dd320896fd87c564c992b0fe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a+c-2b)+p(i+k-2j)=0\\]\" width=\"248\" height=\"18\" />\nOr\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/b/07bb9ee949fc8d2b06bd38584d72962d9536be06.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[p(2j-i-k)=3e\\]\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />\nClearly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/0/2e092b79a8c20523f03481c4e1091b37db132ee8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;e&lt;p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />. It follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a649a410d04311ab8fa77d9468bf8caa93debb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\mid 3e\\implies p=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/5/0553b856bb0eedd59df6b1cc4f5f767b3a9cb24e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b,a,c)=(0,1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"139\" height=\"20\" />, which gives \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/9/709e81e5a901b16460d98213d3fa26afec3baf94.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A\\equiv 1\\bmod{3},\\quad B\\equiv 0\\bmod{3},\\quad C\\equiv 2\\bmod{3}\\]\" width=\"353\" height=\"16\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/8/e582481e8025eea7147155440d17e8666346d1ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2d\\equiv 1\\bmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/2/b92f93cbf4ac2a74ac54facbf77146786eba4276.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2d=1+3x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"16\" />, which needs to be even. Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/0/ea0a9b5d7beba00b7c3c262cbf3eb5bee8c6c42a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2y-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/0/0b069bfb24bbe6cc9a6f153a288ef2ec00ebc02d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2d=6y-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>An order-triple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71bc7a66472f14d58d96e940db6ebc9f101b08e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A,B,C)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> is uniquely determined by a solution of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/0/6c0dd5885b4040e1cf8bd99b47a7f6e0f2ff2d8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+2d\\le 99, A\\equiv 1\\bmod{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"208\" height=\"18\" />, while satisfying condition (a). It follows that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/0/1a03bb117023418f47f38ca84ee224d33e16b1d7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A+6y-2\\le 99\\iff y\\le\\frac{101-A}{6}\\]\" width=\"280\" height=\"37\" />\nThe number of solutions for indices <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> given an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />-value is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/5/215e87f2a56754b9c0b8034b8a8d7fa8bd7258a7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left\\lfloor \\frac{101-A}{6}\\right\\rfloor=16+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{5-A}{6}\\right\\rfloor\\]\" width=\"213\" height=\"43\" />\nFor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf22d5ba4d951a2ea0de3df0cc761a33c38060b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A\\in \\{1,4,\\ldots, 94\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" />, the number of order-triples <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71bc7a66472f14d58d96e940db6ebc9f101b08e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A,B,C)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/1/3f11cb29f75cc11cc66e1c8d70f85bf158a38e4b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[16+16+15+15+\\ldots+1+1=\\boxed{272}\\]\" width=\"307\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~Pieandpi3141592653589732\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I\" title=\"2013 AIME I\">2013 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2013\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2013 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017063014\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 647/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1756/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 115/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 20501/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.152      1 -total\n 59.11%    7.183      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.16%    4.759      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11843:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017063014 and revision id 289656. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}